    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912170/extras/5b7fbe6ea188e0ed0e19840e04003623.avif?t=1676083573\" /></div><br>Thunder League is a strategic fast-paced MOBA-styled game supporting up to 5 vs 5 in each match, where you play as a team to complete objectives against the opposing team.<br><br>With absolutely <strong>no pay to win</strong> schemes; take full control of your gameplay and master several strategies in this <strong>skill-based game</strong> that rewards <strong>team work</strong>!<br><br>Thunder League Online offers both competitive &amp; casual game modes with many more to arrive.<br><br>Play as various <strong>unique agents</strong> and use their <strong>unique abilities</strong> to change the outcomes of this chaotic <strong>team-based battle arena</strong>!<br><br><strong>Immerse in an EPIC 5 vs 5 team-work gameplay...</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912170/extras/ab989ac454e5316ffce2e23c351d3eab.poster.avif?t=1676083573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912170/extras/ab989ac454e5316ffce2e23c351d3eab.webm?t=1676083573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912170/extras/ab989ac454e5316ffce2e23c351d3eab.mp4?t=1676083573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912170/extras/948e5e8ceb0f1377647981d1399340dc.poster.avif?t=1676083573\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912170/extras/948e5e8ceb0f1377647981d1399340dc.webm?t=1676083573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src